5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to know if our past projects actually worked for the people using them.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about how long these projects take and how the rooms are used later.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The schedules keep slipping. I want to see why the calendar is always compressed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,The costs on paper never match reality. I need to see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The same few staff are doing all the work. I want to check their workload.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, if the schedule slips, does that affect the quality of the final space?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, yes, but I am more worried about the hidden time costs during construction.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, exactly. The weather and unexpected issues eat up our buffer weeks.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Shunichi, if the staff are overworked, does that increase the risk of errors?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Kenji, it does. But I am looking at the staffing posts specifically.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will look into the post-occupancy reviews and the survey findings in older blocks.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the timetable records and the booking data for rooms.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will investigate the weather days in site diaries and the delivery schedules.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at the tender records and the renewal reserve for equipment.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the staffing posts and the bench technicians' routines.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let's see what the data says before we pick a winner.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. Data is better than guesswork.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I hope the numbers are clear.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I am ready to see the real costs.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's hope the staff data is as clear as the rest.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
