35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The post-occupancy reviews show that shared spaces are rated much higher than single-wing ones.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The booking data shows specialist rooms are idle, but general rooms are always full.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The site diaries show we lost six weeks to weather on the last two jobs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"The tender records show mechanical costs rose by a fifth, but surfacing costs stayed flat.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The staffing posts show front-of-house roles are unfilled, but technicians have spare hours.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Victoria, that explains why the general rooms are so popular. We need more of them.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, yes, but the timetable records show we pay for off-site space when rooms are closed.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, the weather loss is significant. We need to plan for that.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, the mechanical cost rise is worrying. We need to budget for that.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mizuki, the technicians could help with the upkeep if we reassign them.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"The survey findings in older blocks show hazardous materials, which adds months to the timeline.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,The booking data confirms that general-purpose rooms are in high demand all year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The delivery schedules show that comfort-based projects slip, while inspection-based ones are on time.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"The renewal reserve for equipment was never opened, so we are paying for replacements out of pocket.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The bench technicians spend hours on manual checks because the equipment is outdated.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,We need a project that is shared and doesn't have hidden costs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,A project that is well-used and doesn't disrupt the timetable too much.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,A project that accounts for weather and schedule risks.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Kenji,,A project that has realistic costs and no hidden equipment replacement fees.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,A project that doesn't burden the already stretched staff.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
